  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Agencias Regionales de Desarrollo Productivo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Productive Development Agencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Brindar el apoyo tcnico y metodolgico requerido para desarrollar en el pas el proceso de instalacin de un Sistema Nacional de Desarrollo Productivo Regional que exprese un nuevo concepto y estrategia de desarrollo descentralizado, para promover la capacidad competitiva del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide the technical and methodological support required to put in place a process for the creation of a National System of Regional Productive Development that responds to a new concept and strategy for decentralized development in Chile, in order to promote the country&apos;s competitive capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
